⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
399 calories 41g protein (for the entire pint, toppings included) 😋🤤
Netflix & Chill’d Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free @fairlife Milk
- 40-45g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 8g (½ tbsp) Peanut Butter
- 16g (2 tbsp) Peanut Butter powder
- 1.5g (¼ tsp and a pinch more) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 10g crushed up pretzels
- ½ of a @Prime Bites Protein Treats Protein Brownie
399 cal 29g C, 13g F, 41g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with pretzels and crumbled up brownie pieces

